{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/844095-1001-scary-sights","id":844095,"title":"1001 Scary Sights","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-03-08T12:24:20-08:00","id":844095,"title":"1001 Scary Sights","content":"<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">For all game lines. Let's make a game of it, and make it not immediately obvious which game line it's about, ok? </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">1) Annalise is 9 years old and she's the most charming girl you'll ever meet. The thing inside her is ageless; a former servant of a careless god, who she eventually abandoned. It's also one of the real power players of her kind in the city. And why would she not hide inside a child? Children are so easily manipulated. It's so simple to make them give away information they think doesn't matter, pieces of their lives, souls, anything. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> 2) It's always the same person. He looks like a monk, except you can't see his face behind his black cowl. All you know is that you - only you - can see him anywhere, even in the most improbable situations.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">Only minutes away he was just about to lift his cowl. You turned away and ran. You don't really want to see his face. <br /> </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">3) She says she wants to see God, again. She saw Him, once - he was the Word and the Word had her face and it was holy. She didn't show His face to her again, but He will. Once she has sinned enough, so much He can't avert His face anymore. Soon the killing will begin. <br /> </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">4) It's a lovely evening with your best friends of many years, especially when they tell you how exactly they're going to dismember your corpse tomorrow morning. </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">Wait. They didn't just - No. You must have misheard. <br /> </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">5) All skyscrapers in the city have just now turned, to face you. All of them. And everyone else acts like nothing just happened. You hope you'll wake up soon, but it doesn't seem to happen. <br /> </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">6) There's warm blood on your hands. Somewhere far away, a child cries. <br /> </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">7) A man with hell in his eyes told you to slit your throat. You spent the last 10 minutes staring at your razor, wondering what it feels like, if it really hurts that much, if it's such a bad way to go. <br /> </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">8) Women. Girls, really. None of them here by choice. A woman, who might as well be one of them, looking like that, asks each of them to to sign a contract about their immortal soul. The body of the first one who didn't sign is still in the room. <br /> </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">9) Are you really that drunk? Can't even open the door to your house. Oh well. The neighbours don't seem to be around. No lights anywhere, to be exact. </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">That's when you hear the howls. </span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/286-christian-a","name":"Christian A","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"832"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-08T12:35:33-08:00","id":844100,"title":"","content":"10) You end up some place purely by accident. Everyone there treats you deferentially, and you are pretty sure they are terrified of you. When you find out the date, years have passed since you last were aware. Was something using your body for a reign of terror? Or merely your face? And what are all of these people going to do when they find out you aren't <i>them</i> any longer?<br /> <br /> (Time passing is optional. It might be more of a mind-screw if no time passed at all.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-08T21:56:24-08:00","id":844345,"title":"","content":"11) You woke up today with a significant other that you've been dating for over a month - this wasn't true when you went to bed. And no one believes you when you tell them. (For more fun, make the relationship longer term - you've been married for years, but weren't yesterday.)<br /> <br /> 12) An eye opened in your forehead this morning while you were brushing your teeth - it <i>sees</i> things.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-09T10:25:04-08:00","id":844591,"title":"","content":"13) Every time you go to sleep now, you wake up as someone else. Well, you wake up as <i>you</i>, but with an entirely different past. 3 nights ago, you were a vicious drug kingpin and almost had your throat ripped out by some monster. You are starting to dread each awakening.<br /> <br /> 14) People suddenly stop paying attention to you. No matter what you do, you can't get anyone to really acknowledge you exist beyond a few moments. When you stumble into a bathroom, you finally find someone who can - <i>your reflection</i>. Who was wondering why they couldn't see <i>their</i> reflection in the mirror anymore.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-09T21:01:45-08:00","id":844897,"title":"","content":"15) You started finding cameras dotting the route you took to work. One day, you smashed a few of them. The next time you took that now unmonitored stretch, you were attacked by something you can barely describe. You leave the cameras alone now. <br /> <br /> 16) Your new apartment is cheap, nice, and completely normal. The other tenants seem pretty nice, too. You've even gotten to know a few of them. Of course, now you're starting to realize that they all seem to have the same interests, opinions, quirks, preferences, and verbal tics.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-10T12:08:13-08:00","id":845205,"title":"","content":"17) Can't you hear the music? The sweet serenade of something that subtly slips and slides beneath your skin? Can't you dance on your broken legs?<br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fHjF8Nw-mco\" data-code=\"fHjF8Nw-mco\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/fHjF8Nw-mco/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-10T15:50:56-08:00","id":845329,"title":"","content":"18) Don't you hate it when all your clothes are in the wash and the only thing you have to wear is the suit of shapeshifting powered armor you found in your garage?<br /> <br /> 19) You can blow things up with your mind. Unfortunately, if you go too long without blowing something up you get the worst headaches. Sometimes it happens without you meaning to do it. It's a delicate balance. <br /> <br /> 20) There are a lot of undead monstrosities out there. Turns out that a good chunk of them would rather be human, and would do pretty much anything to cheat their way to humanity. So what happens when one finds a way to swap bodies with the first beating heart he can trap? So now you're stuck in an undead body, and some creep is running around in yours. Oh, and if you stay too long in Count Asshole's body, the thing he used to share it with is gonna take enough bites out of your soul that soon enough you're gonna go full vampire.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T19:26:49-07:00","id":972284,"title":"","content":"21) Everyone has herd of one or two actors who some how even though they keep making shitty movies they keep getting work and studios keep giving them money to make more crappy movies. All the characters are actors are forced into working in this movie. As the movie goes on it becomes clearer with each passing day that its not the director in control but the actor. When convincing their agent speak with the director about everything. The next day the director commits suicide at home and the agent quits out of fear. The agent quits and checks himself into a mental facility. Even if the characters quit contracts and horrible things happening force them into continuing the movie. (I was thinking the actor had a combination of physic powers.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-19T13:24:31-07:00","id":972679,"title":"","content":"22) At random intervals when you happen to glance at a reflective surface, store window, even true mirrors in public restrooms, you catch a glimpse of a blurred figure watching you but when you turn around for a good look they're gone, from the mirror to.<br /> <br /> \u200b23) You found an urban fantasy novel for cheap in a used bookstore. The cover and title page are long gone so you have no idea what it's called, who wrote it or even when it was published, but it was really good being both engaging and surprisingly consistent for a work of fantasy. Thing is since reading it you swear you've begun to notice some of those fantasy elements peeking out in real life. Even worse, you're starting to think they've noticed you to.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":6084,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6084-2pttakrill","user":"2ptTakrill","date":". 09-19-2016, 04:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6084-2pttakrill","name":"2ptTakrill","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"942"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-19T15:37:15-07:00","id":972776,"title":"","content":"24) An old friend from childhood meets you for lunch where you catch up with each other. Your friend asks how your brother Ray is doing, which is confusing because you don't have a brother named Ray. Your friend asks if something happened to him, if there was some kind of falling out, but you insist that you never had a brother named Ray. The conversation deteriorates from there and you both walk away with your feathers ruffled.<br /> <br /> Later, when you think back on that conversation, you can't help but remember that one room in your old house that never got used for anything.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/233-daydreamer","name":"Daydreamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar233_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"193"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T11:13:25-07:00","id":973247,"title":"","content":"25) Alternate take on #24.<br /> \u200bAfter high school you left town for nearly a decade (joined the Army, graduate school) without once coming back to your home town to visit. Now life has brought you back and you looked up all your old friends only to find one missing and no one else remembers him. You had just about accepted that you were wrong (and called a shrink) when one day while going through your old year book you found him, just a face in the background of one of those candid shots in the hall but there he was.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6084-2pttakrill","name":"2ptTakrill","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"942"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}